    },
    {
      "end": 49.02000045776367,
      "text": "Cruisin' through these streets and I'm a OG",
      "start": 46.720001220703125
    },
    {
      "end": 50.900001525878906,
      "text": "So you know me, so OG",
      "start": 49.02000045776367
    },
    {
      "end": 53.79999923706055,
      "text": "Don't approach me with animosity",
      "start": 51.619998931884766
    },
    {
      "end": 56.619998931884766,
      "text": "Hatred is I can't hang with",
      "start": 54.20000076293945
    },
    {
      "end": 59.380001068115234,
      "text": "I'ma get it in, can you paint this?",
      "start": 56.900001525878906
    },
    {
      "end": 63.58000183105469,
      "text": "You know I can't tell you how you should live it in",
      "start": 60.2400016784668
    },
    {
      "end": 64.76000213623047,
      "text": "When we get it in",
      "start": 63.58000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 68.72000122070312,
      "text": "You know I can't tell you how you should live it in",
      "start": 64.83999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 70,
      "text": "When we get it in",
      "start": 68.72000122070312
    },
    {
      "end": 73.94000244140625,
      "text": "You know I can't tell you how you should live it in",
      "start": 70.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 75.36000061035156,
      "text": "When we get it in",
      "start": 73.94000244140625
    },
    {
      "end": 78.9800033569336,
      "text": "We get it in, we win, you lose",
      "start": 75.72000122070312
    },
    {
      "end": 82.58000183105469,
      "text": "Ha-ha, because you snooze in while we out workin'",
      "start": 78.9800033569336
    },
    {
      "end": 85.27999877929688,
      "text": "Every fuckin' day to get that money we hurtin'",
      "start": 82.58000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 88.16000366210938,
      "text": "But it's nothin', we gettin' better by time",
      "start": 85.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 90.81999969482422,
      "text": "Tryin' to climb as head of our time",
      "start": 88.16000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 94.12000274658203,
      "text": "We been born in 81, now it's 2021",
      "start": 90.81999969482422
    },
    {
      "end": 96.08000183105469,
      "text": "It's time to come with them guns",
      "start": 94.12000274658203
    },
    {
      "end": 97.55999755859375,
      "text": "We use words as our weapons",
      "start": 96.08000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 100.0999984741211,
      "text": "Mic on a pen, writing the sand",
      "start": 97.72000122070312
    },
    {
      "end": 101.9000015258789,
      "text": "But we don't like the sand behind",
      "start": 100.0999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 104.12000274658203,
      "text": "Cause we got kids, we doin' the thing",
      "start": 101.9000015258789
    },
    {
      "end": 107.05999755859375,
      "text": "You wanna get it in, we choosin' the same thing",
      "start": 104.12000274658203
    },
    {
      "end": 110.05999755859375,
      "text": "It's hard to make money, bitch, when you get it in",
      "start": 107.05999755859375
    },
    {
      "end": 113.18000030517578,
      "text": "You know I'm good for it, good for it, good for it",
      "start": 110.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 115.94000244140625,
      "text": "Bitch, and you know me, bitch, you know me",
      "start": 113.18000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 118.41999816894531,
      "text": "You know I'm good for it, good for it, good for it",
      "start": 115.94000244140625
    },
    {
      "end": 121.31999969482422,
      "text": "Pockets, pockets, pockets, thank you for the money",
      "start": 118.9000015258789
    },
    {
      "end": 123.68000030517578,
      "text": "I don't even know if you even understand",
      "start": 121.31999969482422
    },
    {
      "end": 126.81999969482422,
      "text": "I gave you so much lies, you brought some motherfucker in the hand",
      "start": 123.68000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 129.02000427246094,
      "text": "And the man doesn't understand",
      "start": 126.87999725341797
    },
    {
      "end": 130.89999389648438,
      "text": "It's just a game, man",
      "start": 129.02000427246094
    },
    {
      "end": 133.17999267578125,
      "text": "A game where you take it over",
      "start": 131.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 134.9600067138672,
      "text": "Fuckin' like a first street motherfucker",
      "start": 133.17999267578125
    },
    {
      "end": 138.32000732421875,
      "text": "We touch down next time, next time you'll think",
      "start": 134.9600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 143.74000549316406,
      "text": "When you try to get it in, you get it in",
      "start": 141.05999755859375
    },
    {
      "end": 147.55999755859375,
      "text": "When we get it in, you come out and kill me",
      "start": 143.74000549316406
    },
    {
      "end": 153.77999877929688,
      "text": "Now you hearin' me?",
      "start": 151.63999938964844
    },
    {
      "end": 155.97999572753906,
      "text": "Are you forcin'?",
      "start": 154.82000732421875
    }
